+## Routes
+
+The complete route list is under "Routes" in `README.md`.
+
+- `POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }`.
+  `soldAt` must be an ISO instant with a timezone; dishId and qty are positive
+  integers. Returns `{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }` (new unique tickets and
+  total portions imported). Existing tickets are skipped. Every row is validated;
+  an invalid row or stock shortage rejects the entire file with `sales_row`
+  and a message naming the physical CSV row (the first data row is row 2).
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array of
+  `{ "itemId": 1, "theoretical": 0.6, "actual": 0.9, "variance": 0.3 }`.
+  Dates are inclusive UTC days; from must not exceed to. Quantities are in
+  the item's unit, at three decimal precision. Variance is actual minus
+  theoretical. Actual includes every consume movement, including cooking
+  and sales. Items with neither kind of use are omitted.
